{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"5173","title":"Xiaomi Auto Unleashes Track-Dominating \"Track Package\" and Exclusive \"Nürburgring Limited Edition\" for Xiaomi SU7 Ultra","desc":"From Xiaomi SU7 Ultra with Serious Track Upgrade (RMB 629,900) to Ultimate Collector's Item (RMB 814,900)","view_cnt":"15869","like_cnt":"3","add_time":"1750926468","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/665_operatorx_operatorx_opx/26/06/2025/7e64b5f2c9466cc6d14f99f6e2b99377.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, June 26th, 2025\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e— Xiaomi Auto today announced the official market launch and commencement of deliveries for its flagship Xiaomi SU7 Ultra series, featuring two high-performance variants: the track-focused \"Track Package\" and exclusive \"Nürburgring Limited Edition\".\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe standard Xiaomi SU7 Ultra is priced at RMB 529,900, with the optional \"Track Package\" available for RMB 100,000 (bringing total configuration to RMB 629,900). The ultra-exclusive \"Nürburgring Limited Edition\" commands a premium price of RMB 814,900, reflecting its collector-grade status and track-honed engineering.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrom its inception, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra set an ambitious goal: to conquer the Nürburgring Nordschleife. A lap time at the Nürburgring is the ultimate test of technological prowess — where high performance is built on cutting-edge innovation, premium quality, and uncompromising reliability. Xiaomi Auto has rooted itself at the Nürburgring, relentlessly refining its technology on the track and applying these advancements to mass-produced models. This is the true significance of our Nürburgring challenge.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe proudly announce: Xiaomi SU7 Ultra production model has set the Fastest Electric Executive Vehicle record at the Nürburgring Nordschleife with a lap time of 7:04.957, establishing itself as the undisputed leader in high-performance EVs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/328_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/06/2025/b6a323e09307b8fe463c4bb5b6743e51.jpg\" alt=\"The Xiaomi SU7 Ultra broke the electric executive car lap record at the Nürburgring North Loop with a time of 7'04\u0026quot;957, making it the fastest mass-produced electric executive car in the history of Nürburgring.\"\u003eMeanwhile, this time under optimal conditions, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra Prototype achieved an even faster lap time, improving by\u003cspan\u003e\u0026nbsp;24\u003c/span\u003e\u0026nbsp;seconds to\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan\u003e6:22.091\u003c/span\u003e, securing 3rd place overall on the Nürburgring Nordschleife leaderboard and setting a new prototype lap record.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/730_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/06/2025/5f34a95b082ab1b2e09ead9e812dd8e1.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\"Track Package\": The Ultimate Track-Ready Configuration\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra comes standard with an impressive array of performance-enhancing components, including Xiaomi Hyper Tri-Motor system, a track-grade high-power battery pack, a track-optimized cooling system, a track-optimized braking system, dual-chamber air springs, and high-performance adaptive dampers. This track-ready configuration straight from the factory delivers 1,548 PS maximum power, accelerates from 0-100 km/h in just 1.98 seconds (without one-foot rollout), and achieves a top speed of 350 km/h. Xiaomi SU7 Ultra features a peak chassis system tuned at the Nürburgring, delivering superior control and pushing the limits of handling performance - making it track-ready straight from the factory.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor enthusiasts demanding even greater track capability, the optional \"Track Package\" includes Bilstein EVO R for Ultra coilover shock absorbers, ENDLESS high-performance brake pads, Pirelli P ZERO 5th-generation high-performance tires, an additional set of Pirelli P ZERO TROFEO RS semi-slick tires, 21-inch U-shaped forged wheels, carbon fiber rear wheel arches, and a 1.7㎡ carbon fiber roof. Priced at RMB 100,000, this package brings the total vehicle cost to RMB 629,900.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/704_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/06/2025/0dea2968c59ad1a87be8e42ac89e4cd8.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNürburgring\u0026nbsp;Limited Edition: Factory-Equipped Ultimate Performance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Auto proudly introduces Xiaomi SU7 Ultra \"Nürburgring Limited Edition\" - a fully road-legal model celebrating its Nürburgring record-breaking achievement. This exclusive version comes complete with Track Package, carbon fiber dual-vent hood, carbon fiber rear spoiler, full carbon fiber exterior trim, carbon fiber interior package, and distinctive Ultra Lightning decals.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGoing beyond extreme specifications, it features FIA-certified custom carbon fiber racing bucket seats in front with included competition-grade 6-point harness. The rear seats have been removed and replaced with semi-roll cage, increasing torsional rigidity by 12% while reducing weight by 30kg, with 57% improved roof crush resistance. For enhanced track performance, carbon fiber underbody aero panel adds up to 44kg downforce during circuit use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/779_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/06/2025/e92f60450ec358e0a6218313face0756.jpg\" alt=\"Two racing seats are placed side by side, designed in black with safety belts, and the background is dark.\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/519_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/06/2025/4e5c93bc3e7253f64f1f7f66e4acacc8.jpg\" alt=\"The yellow safety cage is installed inside the car, with a dark interior as the background and racing seats in the back.\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/182_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/26/06/2025/09112a035133902f6c942ef4061eebd5.jpg\"\u003ePriced at RMB 814,900, Xiaomi SU7 Ultra \"Nürburgring Limited Edition\" represents the ultimate factory-built, road-legal four-door car with championship-level equipment. The 2025 model year will be strictly limited to just 10 units, with total production capped at 100 examples to ensure exclusivity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable style=\"min-width: 75px;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol style=\"min-width: 25px;\"\u003e\u003ccol style=\"min-width: 25px;\"\u003e\u003ccol style=\"min-width: 25px;\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersion\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConfiguration\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTrack Package\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilds upon standard production model with:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e21-inch U-shaped forged wheels\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePirelli® P ZERO™ 5th-gen high-performance tires\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePirelli® P ZERO™ TROFEO RS semi-slick tires (free replacement available through authorized Xiaomi Auto service centers)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBilstein® EVO R for Ultra height-adjustable coilovers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCarbon fiber rear wheel arches\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eENDLESS® high-performance brake pads\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1.7㎡ carbon fiber roof\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eRMB 100,000\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e(Total configured price: RMB 629,900)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNürburgring Limited Edition\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrack Package\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustom high-performance carbon fiber racing bucket seats\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCompetition-grade 6-point harness\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSteel half-roll cage + rear seat removal\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eExclusive in-car limited edition plaque\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUltra Lightning decals\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCarbon fiber aerodynamic underbody panel (track use only)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFree replacement available through authorized Xiaomi Auto service centers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"2\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRMB\u0026nbsp;814,900\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCarbon fiber dual-vent hood\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCarbon fiber exterior package (carbon fiber mirrors, side skirts)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCarbon fiber interior package (carbon fiber scuff plates, door trim, rear AC vent trim)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCarbon fiber rear spoiler\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra represents the ultimate dream car for discerning drivers who demand peak performance, exhilarating driving dynamics, and extraordinary engineering excellence. This remarkable machine blends formidable power with refined execution, delivering exceptional capability on both road and track. Orders are now available in Mainland China through Xiaomi Auto App or Xiaomi Auto WeChat Mini Program.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;MiSans Latin\u0026quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003eProduct images and videos available here: \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/Em2TEmCUY0dMtqE8ctaVFQoBZcMrl4-svR-Wb62W1oyq7w?e=cGnoji\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;MiSans Latin\u0026quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra Track Package\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;MiSans Latin\u0026quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/ElKp-0w9NChLn-NkXGqBOggBooWR22bcD4lfyi79nAeLjg?e=LFthMa\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;MiSans Latin\u0026quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra \u003c/span\u003eNürburgring\u0026nbsp;Limited Edition\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisclaimers:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cem\u003eData in this press release was retrieved from Xiaomi \u003c/em\u003eAuto\u003cem\u003e Lab and/or partners, and may vary depending on models/configurations.\u003c/em\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cem\u003eXiaomi SU7 Ultra and its functions are currently only available in Mainland China.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/em\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In March 2025, the MAU reached approximately 718.8 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 943.7 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of March 31, 2025. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2024, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the sixth year in a row.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"7479","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1750941815"},"common":null}